      "REA CURVE2",
      "Triad Family"
    ],
    "claim_boundary": "DMT-001 supplies four explicit generic sections on each of the six regularity-selected triads. Rank Hunter operationally verifies generic lower bound >=4 by exact independence of those four sections at the good specialization t=12/5; specialized rank is certified separately. Frozen CEF high-rank point bundles are candidate evidence and require independent Rank Hunter certification before promoting rigorous lower bounds.",
    "publication_status": "preprint",
    "publication_date": "2026-09-12",
    "source_commit": "3f53baaedcbdb852e2e999578bf0f75850ad3e5f",
    "plugin_release_baseline_commit": "36d37730ded550a04ceb383434c466afd81e54c9"
  },
